monday.com, our global marketing department has seen a \u003cb\u003e40% improvement in cross-team collaboration\u003c/b\u003e for successful end-to-end campaign planning and execution.","pricingPage.testimonials.defaults.genpact.personName":"Sarah Pharr","pricingPage.testimonials.defaults.genpact.personTitle":"AVP, Marketing, Genpact","pricingPage.products.core.title":"work management","pricingPage.products.core.longTitle":"monday work management","pricingPage.products.core.longTitleBold":"\u003cb\u003emonday\u003c/b\u003e work management","pricingPage.products.core.header.main":"Our core platform to run and scale any workflow","pricingPage.products.core.header.secondary":"Start your 14-day free trial. No credit card needed.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.description":"Manage all your team’s work in one place","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.ai_credits":"AI credits","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.ai_credits.description":"Run AI powered features that streamline your work","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.sidekick_ai_assistant":"Sidekick AI Assistant (Limited)","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.sidekick_ai_assistant.description":"An intelligent, context-aware AI assistant that understands, connects and runs your work.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.description":"Get exclusive features for your organization","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.description":"For individuals looking to keep track of their work","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.description":"Streamline complex workflows at scale","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.standard.description":"Collaborate \u0026 optimize your work across teams","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.247CUstomerSupport":"24/7 customer support","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.247CUstomerSupport.description":"Get assistance anytime from our award-winning Support Team.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.5GBStorage":"5GB storage","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.5GBStorage.description":"Store a high volume of files, images, \u0026 important documents.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.dashboardBasedOn1Board":"Create a dashboard based on 1 board","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.dashboardBasedOn1Board.description":"Gain insights about your work by visualizing your data in different ways.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.unlimitedFreeViewers":"Unlimited free viewers","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.unlimitedFreeViewers.description":"Give viewers read-only access to data within your account.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.unlimitedBoard":"Unlimited boards","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.unlimitedBoard.description":"Add as many boards as you like. Boards are the place for organizing your work and data (e.g. projects, clients, processes).","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.200plusTemplates":"200+ templates","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.200plusTemplates.description":"Choose from templates tailored to every industry \u0026 customize them to fit your needs.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.20plusColumnTypes":"20+ column types","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.20plusColumnTypes.description":"Build your board the way you want with a variety of column types.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.iosAndAndroidApps":"iOS and Android apps","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.iosAndAndroidApps.description":"Stay connected on the go and access monday.com from your smartphone.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.unlimitedItems":"Unlimited items","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.unlimitedItems.description":"Create \u0026 keep track of any information, including tasks, projects, \u0026 customers.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.5GbFileStorage":"5GB file storage","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.5GbFileStorage.description":"Store and easily find the project files you need.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.prioritisedCustomerSupport":"Prioritised customer support","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.prioritisedCustomerSupport.description":"Enjoy all the benefits of our unmatched support team.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.activityLog1Week":"Activity log (1 week)","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.basic.features.activityLog1Week.description":"Track all changes to your work and see who changed what and when over the last week.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.advancedReportingAndAnalytics":"Advanced reporting \u0026 analytics","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.advancedReportingAndAnalytics.description":"Slice and dice everything and get actionable insights from the data.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.ai_credits":"AI credits","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.ai_credits.description":"Run AI powered features that streamline your work","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.sidekick_ai_assistant":"AI Sidekick (plus)","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.sidekick_ai_assistant.description":"Enjoy the full power of an intelligent, context-aware AI assistant that understands, connects and runs your work","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.dashboardCombined50boards":"Create a dashboard that combines 50 boards","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.dashboardCombined50boards.description":"Bigger dashboards that can pull high level insights from up to 50 boards per dashboard.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.dashboardCombined50boards_max_diff":"Dashboard that\u2028combines up to 50 boards","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.dashboardCombined50boards_max_diff.description":"Bigger dashboards that can pull high level insights from up to 50 boards per dashboard.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.enterpriseAutomationsAndIntegrations":"Enterprise-scale automations \u0026 integrations","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.enterpriseAutomationsAndIntegrations.description":"Includes 250K automation \u0026 integration actions per month.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.enterpriseSecurityAndGovernance":"Enterprise-grade security \u0026 governance","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.enterpriseSecurityAndGovernance.description":"Get top-tier security features \u0026 user management controls.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.multiLevelPermissions":"Multi-level permissions","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.multiLevelPermissions.description":"Robust permissions at every level to give you full control.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.premiumSupport":"Enterprise support","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.premiumSupport.description":"24/7 quality support with a priority queue included.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.unlimitedPortfolios":"Unlimited portfolios","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.unlimitedPortfolios.description":"Centralize multiple projects under one umbrella to gain a holistic view of all your projects. See progress, identify potential risks and execute at scale.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.advancedDependencies":"Advanced dependencies","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.enterprise.features.advancedDependencies.description":"Identify delays with lead and lag dependencies that prevent projects from being completed on time by quickly seeing which tasks are behind schedule.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.unlimitedWorkdocs":"Unlimited workdocs","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.unlimitedWorkdocs.description":"Collaborate \u0026 execute ideas \u0026 workflows on a real-time document.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.upTo3Boards":"Up to 3 boards","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.limitedColumnTypes":"8 column types","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.limitedColumnTypes.description":"Build your board the way you want with a variety of column types.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.iosAndAndroidApps":"iOS and Android apps","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.iosAndAndroidApps.description":"Stay connected on-the-go and access monday.com from your smart phone.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.200plusTemplates":"200+ templates","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.200plusTemplates.description":"Choose from over 200+ templates for every industry, and customize them to fit your team's needs.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.upTo3Docs":"Up to 3 Docs","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.upTo3Docs.description":"Create docs and collaborate with your team in real time. As your collaboration thrives, turn those words into actions with live updated data using monday.com Real Time Engine!","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.upTo3Boards.description":"Boards are the place for organizing all your work and data (e.g. projects, clients, processes).","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.upTo2TeamMembers":"Up to 2 team members","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.upTo2TeamMembers.description":"Collaborate in a team of up to 2 members.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.upTo1000Items":"Up to 1,000 items","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.upTo1000Items.description":"Within boards we have rows, or 'Items' - An Item can be anything you want it to be - Task, project, customer, etc. Each free account starts with 200 free Items. You can get more Items by referring friends to create their own accounts.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.500MbStorage":"500 MB of storage","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.free.features.500MbStorage.description":"More storage means more space to save files, images, and important documents.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.automations25K":"Automations (25K actions per month)","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.automations25K.description":"Set automated actions in your board to boost your workflow.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.chartView":"Chart View","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.chartView.description":"Visualize your data with various types of charts and graphs.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.dashboardCombined10boards":"Create a dashboard that combines 20 boards","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.dashboardCombined10boards.description":"Dashboards are free, each Dashboard can combine data from 1, 5, 10 or 50 boards, depending on your plan.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.formulaColumn":"Formula Column","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.formulaColumn.description":"Use formulas to perform dynamic calculations on your data.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.ai_credits":"AI credits","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.ai_credits.description":"Run AI powered features that streamline your work","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.sidekick_ai_assistant":"AI Sidekick (lite)","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.sidekick_ai_assistant.description":"An intelligent, context-aware AI assistant that runs your work. Start for free, buy more as needed","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.integrations25K":"Integrations (25K actions per month)","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.integrations25K.description":"Integrate your apps and services to move the data you need to and from monday.com.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.privateBoardsAndWorkdocs":"Private boards","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.privateBoardsAndWorkdocs.description":"Private boards are only visible and accessible to you and team members you invite.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.timeTracking":"Time tracking","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.timeTracking.description":"Track and monitor the time spent on each task.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.20portfolios":"20 Portfolios","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.20portfolios.description":"Centralize multiple projects under one umbrella to gain a holistic view of all your projects. See progress, identify potential risks and execute at scale.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.activityLog1Year":"Activity log  (1 year)","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.activityLog1Year.description":"Track all changes to your work and see who changed what and when over the past year.","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.workloadManagement":"Workload management","pricingPage.products.core.tiers.pro.features.workloadManagement.description":"Easily visualize who is over capacity and allocate upcoming tasks and resources accordingly.","pricingPage.products.core.featuresList.resourcePlanner":"Resource planner","pricingPage.products.core.featuresList.resourcePlanner.description":"Seamlessly plan, assign, and adjust resources at the project level using placeholders or direct assignments.","pricingPage.products.core.featuresList.resourceDirectory":"Resource directory","pricingPage.products.core.featuresList.resourceDirectory.description":"Organize your workforce by centralizing attributes such as department, job role, and skills in a unified directory.","pricingPage.products.core.featuresList.capacityManager":"Capacity manager","pricingPage.products.core.featuresList.capacityManager.description":"Plan and balance your team’s workload with tools to assign resources, centralize workforce data, and optimize capacity across projects.","pricingPage.produ