act.","templateCenter.category.title.marketing":"monday.com for marketing","templateCenter.category.title.real_estate":"monday.com for real estate","templateCenter.category.title.biggame":"monday.com for the 2022 Big Game","templateCenter.category.description.biggame":"Customizable templates to plan epic Big Game events.","templateCenter.category.title.content_production":"monday.com for content production","templateCenter.category.title.project_management":"monday.com for project management","templateCenter.category.title.product_management":"monday.com for product management","templateCenter.category.title.sales_customers":"monday.com for sales \u0026 CRM","templateCenter.category.title.design":"monday.com for design","templateCenter.category.title.software_development":"monday.com for software development","templateCenter.category.title.hr":"monday.com for HR","templateCenter.category.title.freelancers":"monday.com for freelancers","templateCenter.category.title.office_operations":"monday.com for office operations","templateCenter.category.title.startup":"monday.com for startups","templateCenter.category.title.education":"monday.com for education","templateCenter.category.title.construction":"monday.com for construction","templateCenter.category.title.venture_capital":"monday.com for venture capital","templateCenter.category.title.manufacturing":"monday.com for manufacturing","templateCenter.category.title.nonprofits":"monday.com for nonprofits","templateCenter.category.title.elevate":"Templates from Elevate 2021","templateCenter.category.description.elevate":"Reimagine your work with our favorite templates from Elevate Conference by monday.com","templateCenter.template.overview":"Overview","templateCenter.template.columns":"Columns","templateCenter.template.automations":"Automations","templateCenter.template.integrations":"Integrations","templateCenter.template.views":"Views","templateCenter.template.search":"Search","templateCenter.template.home":"home","templateCenter.template.featured":"Featured","templateCenter.template.templateCenterName":"Template center","templateCenter.template.views.title":"Visualize your work the way you want to","templateCenter.template.columns.title":"Customize your board to your needs with column types","templateCenter.template.integrations.title":"Centralize all your work with integrations","templateCenter.template.automations.title":"Save time by automating your routine work","templateCenter.template.columns.description":"Everything starts with a visual board. Drag and drop 30+ column types to customize the workflows of your dreams.  From due dates to status columns—keep everything within the context of your actual project, workflow, or process.","templateCenter.template.automations.description":"Leave repetitive work behind by setting up customizable automations within minutes. Instantly send emails when due dates arrive, and receive real-time notifications when tasks are completed so you can focus on the work that matters.","templateCenter.template.integrations.description":"Continue working with your existing tools inside monday.com. Sync due dates with your Google Calendar, instantly share your Dropbox files with your entire team, and more.","templateCenter.template.views.description":"Transform your data to see it your way with a variety of data visualizations including: kanban, calendar, timeline, gantt, map, form, workload, and more.","templateCenter.search.resultsTitle":"Showing %param1% items for","templateCenter.cards.showMore":"Show more","templateCenter.cards.showLess":"Show less","templateCenter.template.columns.subsectionTitle":"Most popular columns for this template","templateCenter.template.views.subsectionTitle":"Most popular views for this template","templateCenter.template.automations.subsectionTitle":"Most popular automations","templateCenter.template.integrations.subsectionTitle":"This templates works best with these integrations","templateCenter.template.columns.subsectionDescription":"The columns recommended below are based on how real teams use the campaign tracking template. Remember every template is completely customizable, so feel free to add or delete any of the additional column types available.","templateCenter.template.views.subsectionDescription":"The views recommended below are based on how real teams use the campaign tracking template. Remember every template is completely customizable, so feel free to switch between the views available to find what works best for you.","templateCenter.template.automations.subsectionDescription":"In addition to the automations included in this template, there is a world of automations available inside monday.com. Explore and add any of the available automations or create a custom automation to fit your specific needs.","templateCenter.template.integrations.subsectionDescription":"The integrations recommended below are based on how real teams use the campaign tracking template. Remember every template is completely customizable, so feel free to switch between different tools available to find what works best for you.","templateCenter.meta.title":"Customizable templates to get your team started in minutes","templateCenter.meta.description":"The monday.com template center offers a variety of templates customizable for every industry, business, and team","templateCenter.marketing.meta.title":"Marketing templates to help your team drive impact | monday.com","templateCenter.content_production.meta.title":"Content production templates to keep you organized | monday.com","templateCenter.project_management.meta.title":"Project management templates to centralize your projects | monday.com","templateCenter.product_management.meta.title":"Product management templates to centralize your projects | monday.com","templateCenter.sales_customers.meta.title":"Sales and CRM templates to customize your pipeline | monday.com","templateCenter.freelancers.meta.title":"Customizable templates to manage any freelance project | monday.com","templateCenter.design.meta.title":"Design templates designed exclusively for creative teams | monday.com","templateCenter.software_development.meta.title":"Software development templates for every sprint","templateCenter.hr.meta.title":"HR templates specifically designed for all your processes | monday.com","templateCenter.office_operations.meta.title":"Operations templates for all your company logistics | monday.com","templateCenter.startup.meta.title":"Customizable templates to help scale your startup | monday.com","templateCenter.biggame.meta.title":"Big Game templates to take your parties and events to the next level | monday.com","templateCenter.education.meta.title":"Education templates to get you started in minutes | monday.com","templateCenter.venture_capital.meta.title":"Venture capital templates to organize your business projects and plan ahead | monday.com","templateCenter.manufacturing.meta.title":"Manufacturing templates to manage projects and orders in one place | monday.com","templateCenter.real_estate.meta.title":"Real estate templates to help track all your work | monday.com","templateCenter.construction.meta.title":"Construction templates to effectively manage any project | monday.com","templateCenter.elevate.meta.title":"Elevate 2021 templates to get your team started within minutes | monday.com","templateCenter.nonprofits.meta.title":"Nonprofit templates to maximize your social impact | monday.com","templateCenter.specificTemplate.meta.title":"%param1% template | monday.com","templateCenter.integration.outlook.description":"Automatically convert emails into action items to track and manage inside monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.teams.description":"Embed monday.com boards within your MS Teams chats to enhance workflow capabilities.","templateCenter.integration.dropbox.description":"Easily attach, share, and preview files stored in your Dropbox from within monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.slack.description":"Share information, updates and files in Slack #channels from directly inside monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.zoom.description":"Set Zoom calls within any monday.com board to communicate in context.","templateCenter.integration.google_calendar.description":"Manage your time more efficiently and stay up-to-date with all important deadlines.","templateCenter.integration.google_drive.description":"Access, attach, and preview any file stored in your Drive directly from your monday.com boards.","templateCenter.integration.excel.description":"Easily import and export any Excel sheet into a board with just a few clicks.","templateCenter.integration.gmail.description":"Automatically convert emails into action items to track and manage inside monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.LinkedIn.description":"Directly integrate your LinkedIn account to create and share posts directly from monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.onedrive.description":"Attach documents in OneDrive to items in monday.com and instantly preview any file.","templateCenter.integration.zapier.description":"Build custom integrations between monday.com and platforms available in Zapier.","templateCenter.integration.adobeCreativeCloud.description":"Visualize your entire design process by managing all your creative workflows directly in Adobe Creative Cloud.","templateCenter.integration.salesforce.description":"Track leads and manage your entire sales pipeline between Salesforce and monday.com with ease.","templateCenter.integration.zendesk.description":"Streamline customer requests, connect your support team to the rest of the company, and handle tickets efficiently.","templateCenter.integration.copper.description":"Better track and manage all your customer relationships with Copper directly inside monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.shopify.description":"Easily sync your Shopify store and monday.com account. Track your products, inventory, and orders in a single glance.","templateCenter.integration.twilio.description":"Add SMS notifications and phone calls to your workflow. Create customized messages to reach relevant people.","templateCenter.integration.stripe.description":"Accept payments, manage your business online, and implement these business changes into your monday.com account.","templateCenter.integration.woocommerce.description":"Get a high-level view of your online store and automatically track your products, inventory, and orders all in one place.","templateCenter.integration.pipedrive.description":"Streamline all of your customer insights into monday.com by converting them into workflows to better manage deals.","templateCenter.integration.surveymonkey.description":"Receive your survey, poll, and quiz results in your monday.com account to help facilitate lead management.","templateCenter.integration.mailchimp.description":"Manage your email campaigns within monday.com. Get the latest stats on deployed emails and collect new leads efficiently.","templateCenter.integration.facebook_adds.description":"Add the data you want to see on your boards to create, manage, and track your Facebook ads all from monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.typeform.description":"Easily organize Typeform submissions in one visual workspace, and add all your data in seconds to monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.hubspot.description":"Manage all your leads and contacts in monday.com to ensure your entire company is collaborating together.","templateCenter.integration.clearbit.description":"Turn any lead into a prospect. Seamlessly pull the right data to understand customers and see the results in monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.jotform.description":"Better manage leads, distribute surveys, and collect payments with your customizable form via JotForm inside monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.box.description":"Upload your files, share them with your teammates, and collaborate on them together in monday.com","templateCenter.integration.eventbrite.description":"Gain insights from your events’ data by integrating all your registrants’ data into your monday.com account.","templateCenter.integration.gitlab.description":"Seamlessly share updates with client-facing teams by managing and tracking bugs within monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.jira.description":"Turn Jira issues into manageable tasks using a two-way sync with monday.com, so teams across the company can stay aligned.","templateCenter.integration.github.description":"Keep everyone in the loop by automatically syncing bugs and features from GitHub into monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.pagerduty.description":"Spend less time reacting to incidents. Manage and track all your digital operations inside monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.toggl.description":"Better manage your time spent on tasks and projects with Toggl insights inside monday.com","templateCenter.integration.basecamp.description":"Automate duplicating tasks from one list to another to easily manage tasks.","templateCenter.integration.asana.description":"Instantly run and track new Asana tasks within your monday.com account.","templateCenter.integration.Trello.description":"See any new card in Trello automatically reflected as a new item in monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.harvest.description":"Track expenses and build time-based reports using your data inside monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.todoist.description":"Sync your Todoist projects and remain updated on any and all changes directly in monday.com.","templateCenter.integration.adobe_creative_cloud.description":"Visualize your entire design process by managing all your creative workflows directly in Adobe Creative Cloud.","templateCenter.longDescription.title":"Why we love this template?","templateCenter.longDescription.readMore":"Read more","templateCenter.benefits.title":"What are the benefits of using this template?","contactOptions.loadingPage.settingUpCall":"Setting up the call","header.s